Got a solution to this. It was NOT an RRO problem. I reproduced it using CRAN R. I got a solution from RStudio. It is to remove your ~/.rstudio-desktop folder. That requires you to reset preferences, but we should probably do that once in a while anyway. I've also fowarded my old .rstudio-desktop folder to the folks at RStudio in hopes they can figure out what caused the issue.

